5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. Let us approach this game with calm minds and kindness.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi! I'm Rin! This is like a big treasure hunt for the wolf, right? How do we start?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should prioritize establishing a baseline of behavior. Let's be honest about our logic so we can spot inconsistencies later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I hope we can all get along and find a peaceful way to solve this.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm Takumi. Let's just get to the point. We find the wolf and kick them out. Simple.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Trust is a fragile thing, but necessary. We should observe each other carefully.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, do you think the wolf will try to act super nice to trick us? That would be so sneaky!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Likely. The Possessed will also try to blend in. We need to look for those who are too eager to deflect suspicion.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Mizuki. Let's try to listen to everyone's thoughts without jumping to conclusions too quickly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Stop overthinking it! We just need to be brave and make a call when someone looks fishy.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Patience is a virtue. Let us see how the first night unfolds before we rush.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm so curious! I wonder who the Seer is! Are you the Seer, @Takumi? You seem very confident!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, asking directly like that might put the Seer in danger. We should let the information emerge naturally.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Maybe we can all just share a bit more about ourselves to build some trust first?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, why are you questioning me already? I'm just being honest. Don't try to pin things on me!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us keep our hearts quiet and our eyes open. I look forward to tomorrow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be watching everyone with my super-detective eyes! This is going to be an adventure!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will be observing the patterns of speech. Let's hope the Seer finds a useful lead tonight.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope everyone has a restful night. Let's try to stay positive tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. I'm ready for this. Just don't get in my way when I find the wolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
