32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I have a feeling we should look closely at Takumi.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, why? Did he do something scary in his sleep? I think he's just grumpy!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that's a bold claim for the first turn. What specific evidence or intuition are you basing this on?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, let's not start with accusations. Maybe we can talk it through gently?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, what's your problem? You're just trying to shift the focus to me because you're scared!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is not about fear, but about a certain clarity I feel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,I noticed @Takumi got really loud yesterday! Does the wolf always get loud when they're nervous?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, loudness isn't proof. However, @Jonathan's sudden focus on Takumi is interesting. Is he the Seer trying to guide us?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think we should listen to what @Jonathan has to say, but let's be fair to @Takumi too.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not nervous! I'm just sick of you guys acting like I'm the bad guy just because I'm not acting like a robot!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I only wish for the village to be safe. The truth is often quiet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, if @Jonathan is the Seer, can he tell us who the wolf is? Or is that a secret?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The Seer can, but the wolf might kill them immediately. @Jonathan, if you have information, please present it logically.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's try to find a consensus that makes everyone feel heard.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, stop acting like you're the boss! You're just as suspicious for trying to control the conversation!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe the evidence points toward Takumi. I suggest we vote accordingly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Hmm, @Takumi is getting really angry... maybe that's a clue? I'm starting to feel a bit suspicious!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi's reaction is purely emotional, which is a poor defense. @Jonathan's persistence is a strong signal. I'll follow the logic.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"If everyone feels that way, I don't want to cause any conflict. I'll go with the majority.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all just ganging up on me! This is ridiculous! I'm the only one actually fighting for us!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
